        <a href="/firma-kaydi" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-5 py-2.5 bg-red-600 hover:bg-red-700 text-white font-bold rounded-xl transition-all shadow-md shadow-red-600/20 text-[13px]">
          Demo
